OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely
OL,6,Fcloudy at first but increasing clear
OL,7,Fspells developing, allowing areas of
OL,8,Ffrost and fog to form. Staying
OL,9,Fcloudier around the coast which may
OL,10,Fmay still see the odd shower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA chilly start with fog in
OL,13,Fplaces. Otherwise mostly dry with
OL,14,Fvariable cloud and bright or sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Some showers around the coast.
OL,16,FFrost and fog possible again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
